<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Interface for reading and reporting TDS probe measurements. </para>

<para>This module reads a TDS probe through an ADC channel, converts the ADC count to voltage, applies temperature compensation, estimates parts-per-million, and can print the latest reading over UART.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>Date</title>

<para>Created on Jun 11, 2026 </para>
</formalpara>
<formalpara><title>Author</title>

<para>malai </para>
</formalpara>
</para>
</section>
